DOMAIN-SUFFIX,miguvideo.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,miguvideo.com.cn,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,migumusic.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,migutv.com,DIRECT
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mgc-games.com,DIRECT

